WEBVTT

00:05:28.541 --> 00:05:32.508
We all need to be challenging
and changing the parts of our work lives

00:05:32.532 --> 00:05:33.750
that are broken.

00:05:35.027 --> 00:05:38.399
So I hope the next time
a coworker invites you

00:05:38.423 --> 00:05:41.685
maybe to join a sign-on
letter to your boss,

00:05:41.709 --> 00:05:44.474
or a group of employees asks for a meeting

00:05:44.498 --> 00:05:48.034
to discuss their concerns
about the new health care plan,

00:05:48.058 --> 00:05:51.116
I hope you'll consider it an opportunity

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.100
to build a better workplace,

00:05:53.124 --> 00:05:55.400
a stronger business

00:05:55.424 --> 00:05:58.057
and an economy that works for all of us.

00:05:58.081 --> 00:05:59.404
Thank you.

00:05:59.428 --> 00:06:03.857
(Applause)